---
description: Subagent ownership so parallel work does not collide on schema, payments, or booking.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Agent ownership

- Booking overlap/holds: `backend/src/bookings/` + `resource-lock.ts` only, coordinated with payments for CONFIRMED.
- Payments/webhooks: `backend/src/payments/` only.
- Prisma schema/migrations: one change at a time; parent agent serializes.
- Public UI tokens/pages vs admin UI: do not restyle both blindly in one edit if another agent owns the other.
- Never put secrets in docs, skills, or git.
